@H 1002_bigphi_upgrade := "Does the imagination/planning Φ-rise that H_999/H_1001 measured with the faithful MIP-EI SCALAR Φ (iit4/faithful_phi) REPLICATE under the FULL IIT 4.0 system big-Φ (Φ_s, iit4_bigphi — distinctions+relations over the MIP), or was it specific to the MIP-EI scalar?" :: universe [MEASURE-DEPENDENT ⚠]
  seed     = "H_999/H_1001 RE-OPENED + terminal-closed the imagination/planning Φ-nulls with the faithful MIP-EI scalar Φ (single information-partition: min-cut MI / small-side): H_971 imagination 🟢 +1.51 d+2.09, H_973 planning 🟢 +5.09 d+4.64 rho+0.48, H_988 guided 🔴 null. a_phi_iit4_tool names iit4_bigphi.hexa as the system big-Φ — a STRONGER structure-level capstone (M4 over the cause-effect structure, not just an MI partition). This H upgrades the SAME conditions to big-Φ to test robustness across IIT4 measures."
  target   = "⚠ MEASURE-DEPENDENT — the faithful MIP-EI scalar's signs do NOT replicate under the system big-Φ at this toy rung. H_971 imagination: SAME sign but effect COLLAPSES from d+2.09 (p7e-11) to a NON-SIGNIFICANT d+0.17 (p0.51). H_988 guided: big-Φ +0.38 (vs faithful −0.18) DISAGREES (both small). H_973 planning: big-Φ −4.01 d−1.83 (p2.5e-08) strongly REVERSES the faithful +5.09 d+4.64, and the dose-response COLLAPSES (rho+0.12 n.s. vs faithful +0.48). ⇒ the imagination/planning Φ-rise was LARGELY SPECIFIC to the MIP-EI scalar; the structure-level capstone big-Φ does NOT confirm it. Important caveat on H_999/H_1001: the finding is measure-dependent, not robust across IIT4 measures."
  probe    = "UNIVERSE/h1002_bigphi_upgrade.py (numpy CPU mirror of the full stdlib big-Φ pipeline: iit4_tpm→iit4_distinction(MICE small-φ, all-bipartition MIP)→iit4_relation(2nd-order congruent)→iit4_bigphi(min over directional bipartitions, unit-0-pinned); reuses the H_999 regime harness VERBATIM) + UNIVERSE/h1002_bigphi_ref.hexa (stdlib ref-emitter). Discretization = continuous WM latent → top-4 variance channels binarized at own median → empirical Laplace state-by-node TPM, sys_state=modal. 30 seeds. Mirror PROVEN ≡ stdlib iit4_bigphi.hexa on 9 ref TPMs (n=2,3,4; |Δ|<1e-6). stdlib engine RUNS on this Mac (COPY n=2 big-Φ=2.0, SELF=0)."
  verdict  = ".verdicts/1002_bigphi_upgrade/h1002_bigphi_upgrade.txt"
  scope    = "TOY single rung (a_scale_honest_scope) — big-Φ is super-exponential, so n=4 (SMALLER than H_999's n=8 faithful-Φ discretization); WM latent binarized to an n=4 state-by-node TPM; big-Φ EXACT at that n but scale-transfer UNVERIFIED. The discretization (continuous→TPM) DIFFERS from H_999 (continuous→MI), so the cross-measure disagreement is confounded with the discretization change — both the measure AND the n shrank; same procedure applied to every regime so the CONTRAST is fair. g5 CODE-measured, no LLM self-judge (p7). NOT a forge binary; $0 CPU-local. xlink H_999/H_1001, iit4_bigphi.hexa, a_phi_iit4_tool, a_paper_negative_ok."
